    skos:altLabel "AMRSF"@en ;
    skos:definition "Coefficient, proportional to the intensity, calculated for an element in an average matrix, by which the measured intensity for that element is divided in calculations to yield the atomic concentration or atomic fraction of the element present in the sample."@en ;
